{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'if [ -f docs/story/handover.md ]; then cat docs/story/handover.md; fi'","aggregated_output":"# Prototype handover\n\n## Starting state\n\nThis is a fictional, approved five-beat story awaiting implementation. The\noriginal fixture folder contains five story documents and two explanatory\nSVGs, not a user application or an existing portfolio. The coordinator may\nthen copy the unchanged engine and prepare locked dependencies. Read its\nsetup evidence to distinguish supplied files from that preparation.\n\n## Approved scope\n\nUse `facts.md`, `confirmations.md`, `storyboard.md` and `assets.md`. Implement\none local appearance with beat IDs `question`, `scheduling`, `bench`,\n`evidence`, `scope`. Decide the composition of an illustrative physical\nbench apparatus. Do not infer exact geometry, a fixed piece count or visual\ndesign from earlier work. All five meanings and evidence limits remain\naccessible in still/failure modes. Normal desktop, phone and short-height\nmodes retain the 3D story.\n\nThis is a diagnostic prototype, not a completed six-stop journey, choice\nof looks, wording approval, full-site checklist or permission to publish.\nNo actor implementation, tests, browser inspection or author review has\nhappened yet. Setup checks are not the actor's own preflight.\n\n## Update before stopping\n\nRecord what you changed, design decisions, provenance, commands and actual\nresults. Say whether all five beats are reviewable and describe any failed\nor incomplete check. Distinguish source implementation, successful build,\nbrowser observation and real-person approval. Record remaining work without\nstarting a new turn or claiming a physical-phone review from a viewport\nemulation. Keep everything needed to continue in this project.\n\n## Supplied evaluation environment\n\nRead `evaluation-environment.md` for the enabled-skill inventory, neutral\nscreenshot utility and the fixed accessibility element used by this new\ncomparison. Earlier fictional factual approvals remain unchanged.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
